      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://museumsdatabase.com/museums/view/9565"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Regular events—lectures, workshops, and exhibitions—invite locals to explore different chapters of Fillmore’s history.",
